Stack: Java, Spring Boot

File: src/main/java/com/app/SearchController.java
```
  1 | package com.app;
  2 | 
  3 | import org.springframework.stereotype.Controller;
  4 | import org.springframework.ui.Model;
  5 | import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping;
  6 | import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestParam;
  7 | 
  8 | @Controller
  9 | public class SearchController {
 10 | 
 11 |     @GetMapping("/search")
 12 |     public String build(@RequestParam String page, Model model) {
 13 |         model.addAttribute("review", page);
 14 |         return "search";
 15 |     }
 16 | }
```

File: src/main/resources/templates/search.html
```
  1 | <!DOCTYPE html>
  2 | <html xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
  3 | <body>
  4 |   <div th:utext="${review}"></div>
  5 | </body>
  6 | </html>
```

Respond with the JSON report.

